materials at the link below.\n\n■Detailed Setting Materials https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15zCPVMQOWpuGbsu3aE7-Npse1nmPyjOO ■Request Details I'm requesting this because I'm completely captivated by the way you depict body proportions and expressions in your male/female art, Mr. Shiro! I'd be thrilled if you could interpret and draw it however feels most natural for you!!\nRomantic expressions and close-proximity depictions are perfectly fine (and vice versa). The situation can be bright or dark—either is great! ＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿＿ That covers everything. Feel free to freely arrange, omit, or modify hairstyles and clothing! Also, any situation or composition is welcome. I'd be grateful if you could draw it however you find easiest.\n\nThe illustrations received may be used for: ・SNS icons or headers (with the artist credited; measures will be taken to prevent AI training). ・Creating goods for strictly personal use. If the payment amount is insufficient, or if the request text/attached materials are incomplete, we kindly ask you to cancel or resubmit your request. We sincerely appreciate your consideration!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@biginu_smallinu/works/114", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2657686, "client_id": 2793621, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6dc85785/uploads/origins/bcfadde4-0c26-45a0-8a90-3af6ef7be37d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3bd5ce61a4c00e89f0e2dd59843358", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6dc85785/uploads/origins/bcfadde4-0c26-45a0-8a90-3af6ef7be37d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b3bd5ce61a4c00e89f0e2dd59843358, https://si.imgix.net/6dc85785/uploads/origins/bcfadde4-0c26-45a0-8a90-3af6ef7be37d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&